Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, and listen good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Viento here, the so-called Pillar Man,\Nuses a mask to turn men into vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does this to make them\Nstronger, and then he devours them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him out while there's still time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of those strong\Nsilent types, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever thought about modeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a nice look there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.74,0:00:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's see what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me some vulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Work with me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make some love to the camera.\NReady? Sit! Give me happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.14,0:01:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show us those pearly whites!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.28,0:01:19.74,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.28,0:01:19.74,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
