Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.37,0:01:23.58,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.37,0:01:23.58,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.58,0:01:26.96,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.58,0:01:26.96,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:01:26.96,0:01:34.21,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.96,0:01:34.21,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.97,0:01:40.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.97,0:01:40.76,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.97,0:01:40.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.76,0:01:49.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.76,0:01:49.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.48,0:01:55.57,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.48,0:01:55.57,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.37,0:02:02.20,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.37,0:02:02.20,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.20,0:02:06.04,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.20,0:02:06.04,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.04,0:02:11.46,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.04,0:02:11.46,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.30,0:02:14.55,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.30,0:02:14.55,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.55,0:02:16.80,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.55,0:02:16.80,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.55,0:02:16.80,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.55,0:02:16.80,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.80,0:02:20.64,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.80,0:02:20.64,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.64,0:02:26.43,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.64,0:02:26.43,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.43,0:02:31.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.43,0:02:31.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close.
