Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smile at the birdie. Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop this nonsense immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't provoke him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Jojo, send me\Ninto his dangerous! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you think he's dangerous, but I\Nhave a theory that maybe he's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me test something out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to assume he's evil just\Nbecause he killed a bunch of brainless...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you, insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:03:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's not evil, why did he\Nkill all my men? Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some would say you're\Nresponsible for what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you the one\Nexperimenting on him and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to blast him\Naway in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I really care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason I'm here\Nis to make sure that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon makes it back\Nto New York safe and south.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm not here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm feeling generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, loosen up, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.70,0:03:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just walked through me\Nlike I wasn't even there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell does this guy think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should teach him a quick lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a nice trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the weirdest feeling and it hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tool, cold and long,\Nwith many different pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.38,0:04:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not simply mimicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took him practically no time at\Nall to completely master our language!
