Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how is he doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took it apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He dismantled that entire weapon\Nlike some expert gunsmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes a soldier dozens of hours to learn\Nhow to fieldstrip his weapon that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using his advanced\Nintellect to learn everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.66,0:04:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This light is new to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We weren't the ones\Nobserving all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was actually watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to learn a new joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stop me if you've\Nheard this one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock, knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock, knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are playing games, Primitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not want to play games.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
