Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.02,0:05:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparks energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This human seems\Ndifferent from the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was not able to absorb\Nhis body into mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just flew away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.86,0:05:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And somehow, his leg, it remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It still seems fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one is something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have yet to see such a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he a unique specimen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or do all humans of his particular\Nclass possess the same properties?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be related to age?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My instinct was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That human is unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it stop, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speed wagon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the old man go, San Viento!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm in the mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, big guy, you\Nwanna try and take me on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem that humans\Nhave evolved their confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Hamon sandwich coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.62,0:06:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Harmon is making that blood float.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Harmon is running off him\Nlike rain off a raincoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's somehow repelling it and\Npushing it into all of this blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His skin is acting like a ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow it's behaving\Njust like Straitzo's scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body and his body seem to be\Nrepelling against one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done to my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can completely remove my thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't anyone have a sense of humor left?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is funny stuff here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But seriously, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky thing I rolled\Nmy wrist just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beast's immune to Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Hamon that was protecting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It kept your body from being\Ncompletely absorbed into that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like eating a blowfish for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows he must kill it first\Nand then remove the poison part!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is how San Viento plans\Non absorbing Jojo's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, too bad for him I'm not a blowfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I need to think\Nof something fast here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's time to make\Nmy emergency escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The danger of San Viento\Nescaping is too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one leaves until he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You released this monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now you're saying you need\Nsomeone else to clean up the mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need anything else\Non my plate, Von Stroheim!
