Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hit to the solar plexus\Ncompletely knocked the wind out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems to create his own energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.86,0:09:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He controls it with his breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But lying there now, unconscious, he\Nis as vulnerable as any other human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to use your harm on breathing!
