Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your harm on breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.65,0:09:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to initiate a\Nself-destruct sequence!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.04,0:09:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the Fatherland!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that if I were you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone just calm down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like my gamble paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figuring that attacks\Nfrom outside are no good,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to send some Hamon into\Nhim while he tries to enjoy his meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited for you to start devouring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your Hamon Blast!
