Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've seen him from\Nthe inside, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His whole body is one\Nbig digestive system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of his cells, they're all\Nfilled with aggressive digestive enzymes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.26,0:10:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making it possible to dissolve his prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's absorbing them, when\Nactually he's digesting them whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.86,0:10:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harmon, that was what kept\Nme from being digested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sent it inside him\Nwhen he tried to eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, your Harmon wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to find a way to\Ncompletely destroy San Viento.
