Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The separated parts of San Viento\Nare trying to connect to one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty much exactly\Nwhat happened with Streetser.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky me, I figured you would\Ntry to go and do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this thing have any weaknesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sunlight, yeah! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was there, on the walls of the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sunlight is his natural enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The very reason he made the masks in\Nthe first place was to conquer the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.30,0:12:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let San Viento\Nescape into the outside world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, I think he needs\Nto go on a nice sunlit stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's running out of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to control his harmone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't had enough training with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fight has completely exhausted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cease this foolishness\Nnow, you lowly primitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must control your hormone breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.90,0:12:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could breathe, I probably wouldn't\Nbe so tired in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we've all had\Njust about enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But fortunately for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're just a few steps away from the\Ntwo of us catching some nice rays!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.66,0:13:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat invade, also known as foul flesh.
