Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're pieces of his flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're feeding on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.22,0:13:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got to stay focused!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never once imagined a human such as\Nyou would be born during my slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
