Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, leave the rest to me,\NColonel Rudolf von Stroheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Opening the door will end all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to help you\Ndestroy this vile creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, von Stroheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have never thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm, well-attempted, primitives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can almost reach the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A meaningless struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just lie there like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to think here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't noticed,\Nwe're both in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see those axes\Non the wall next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reach up and grab one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take one and chop off my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You coward, cut off my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way we're\Ngetting that door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.98,0:14:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right, but\Nare you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, there has got\Nto be some other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.14,0:14:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's recovering, Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm no doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea how to do this right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a proud servant of the Wehrmacht!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am prepared to do whatever\Nis required to fulfill my duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I proudly give up my\Nleg for the Fatherland!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.49,0:15:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it now, Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really want me to chop\Nit off, then off it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand that you chop it off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured this guy was just some bloated\Npower monger, but I gotta hand it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish there was some other way, but if\Nhe's courageous enough, then forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me big guy, how does that\Nsunshine feel on your skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
