Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That monster's trying\Nto crawl inside my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Von Stroheim's basically okay,\Nand he's free of any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get out of me! Run, Viento!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this thing's willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:17:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he stays inside von Stroheim, he'll be\Ntotally fine even here in broad daylight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.88,0:17:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be real!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know what the\Nworst part about this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My leg doesn't even hurt anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels pleasant, you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.00,0:17:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it down, Von Stroheim! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've seen what horrible\Nthings San Viento is capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My destiny has been determined!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now, all I can do is\Ndestroy the both of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have one more thing to say\Nto you before my time is done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you know what's good for you,\Nyou'll listen close, Englishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did not awaken San Viento simply for\Nscientific research or military gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you risk it? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your destiny to hear these\Nwords from my lips, Joe Starr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Viento is just the tip of the iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Wehrmacht has discovered\Nanother pillar in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.88,0:18:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We now know that San Viento is not\Nthe only one of his kind around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait so there's more of them\Nwhere are they tell me Von
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroheim where I'm sorry but I\Ndon't have that answer for you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar there are more pillar\Nmen out there and they have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powers that are beyond our\Nwildest imagination for millennia
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those powers have remained\Ndormant but that won't last and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon they will awaken you must\Nfind another weakness other
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than just sunlight or else\Nhope is lost that's why we were
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,experimenting on San Viento we\Nwere looking for that weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a battle against the\NPillar Man yet to be fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.18,0:18:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The events of 50 years ago\Ncall upon you for that battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will need more than just\Nyour Hamon to overcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must go to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you will find\Nsomeone who can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is someone that your\Nspeed wagon knows very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Viento is trying to move my party\Ninto that well so he can hide again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he can't stop me from opening up my\Nbody completely to let the sun shine in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Von Stroheim, don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human greatness lies in having the\Ncourage to face down one's fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Greek historian Plutarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You annoying Englishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have questions for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that crazy German and all his honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that we could\Nhave found another way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.36,0:20:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cezriato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You annoy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Primitive, I will destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.34,0:20:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steady your breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your hormone technique.
