Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.88,0:20:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Primitive, why oppose me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were doomed here from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know just what you're going to say next!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll say I've seen right through\Nyou all this time, Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen right through\Nyou all this time, Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's high noon over this well!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun reflecting off of the\Nwater should cook you nicely!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I doubt you even thought of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were thinking about jumping under the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.62,0:21:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,night's cool water and\Ngetting out of the sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, screw that idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you touch the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive, thanks to the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.56,0:21:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a statue now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.54,0:21:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally got that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.47,0:22:15.06,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.06,0:22:18.60,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.22,0:22:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out and out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.60,0:22:23.94,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.58,0:22:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.94,0:22:26.61,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.12,0:22:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.52,0:22:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.61,0:22:31.07,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.62,0:22:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.58,0:22:42.17,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.26,0:22:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.17,0:22:45.76,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.76,0:22:51.05,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold and mooding, driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.05,0:22:53.72,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.62,0:22:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.72,0:22:57.73,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:23:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and out around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.73,0:23:00.10,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.18,0:23:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.40,0:23:03.61,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.61,0:23:05.36,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my lover will be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.53,0:23:12.20,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll see you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.95,0:23:18.62,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.42,0:23:25.09,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.09,0:23:27.01,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,There with you
